@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = customer-mahesh
@conversationId = conv-return-policy

### Tool chaining: order status followed by delivery estimate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "cust-101",
  "conversationId": "tool-chain-demo",
  "message": "What is the status of order SK-1001, and will it be delivered by tomorrow? Check the current order status and then retrieve its delivery estimate before answering."
}

